{"parse": {"title": "间隔月-08", "pageid": 101221, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E9%97%B4%E9%9A%94%E6%9C%88-07\" title=\"间隔月-07\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">间隔月-08</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 28px;\"></span></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">间隔月</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">08</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.86.8D.E4.BC.9A.EF.BC.8C.E6.9C.8B.E5.8F.8B\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"再会，朋友\">再会，朋友</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 再会，朋友</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Au revoir, chers amis</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi\"><img alt=\"1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/Cg-1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi.png/600px-Cg-1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/Cg-1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi.png/900px-Cg-1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/dd/Cg-1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi.png/1200px-Cg-1_5_bg_lapulasihuikeshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>指针坐在自己的办公桌前，一如既往地进行着自己的工作。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>我要进来了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"632901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/HeadIconSmall-632901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-632901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"632901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/HeadIconSmall-632901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-632901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4f/HeadIconSmall-632901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-632901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>请进，有什么事吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>冷周六审视着眼前的空间，目光中流露出些许让指针困惑的不满。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>你完全没有开始吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>没关系，等我那边忙完了我们可以帮你一起搬。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>现在，快来看看这个。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"632911.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-632911.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-632911.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"632911.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-632911.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-632911.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-632911.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-632911.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>这是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"632910.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f5/HeadIconSmall-632910.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-632910.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"632910.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f5/HeadIconSmall-632910.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-632910.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f5/HeadIconSmall-632910.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-632910.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>你做了很多修改……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/HeadIconSmall-311601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>虽然你一直没有来信讨论，但我还是把它补全了，包括我之前给你看的那些东西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"632910.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f5/HeadIconSmall-632910.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-632910.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"632910.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f5/HeadIconSmall-632910.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-632910.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f5/HeadIconSmall-632910.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-632910.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>这个低温材料测试的角度是从绿棱镜那里获得的启发？……这样的话，整个研究都会变得完善很多。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"311611.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-311611.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-311611.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"311611.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-311611.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-311611.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-311611.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-311611.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>看起来不错吧？拉普拉斯的评审团队也这么说。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>非常感谢你的工作，冷周六研究员。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>请放心，我一定会在提交论文的时候把你的名字写在通讯作者上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>研究计划被完善是意外之喜，遵照基本的科研道德，指针要确保冷周六会获得应有的荣誉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但冷周六并不为此觉得高兴。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>……通讯作者？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>为什么是通讯作者？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>有好几条小蛇从她头上探出了头，指针据此判断她的同事此时情绪相当激动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>……因为这是我的研究计划，而你正要去拉普拉斯总部，加入别的项目？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>别的项目？没有别的项目——这就是我的项目，我们的项目，我接下来准备开展的研究项目！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在争执进一步升级之前，冷周六终于意识到了被自己遗漏的关键。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>等等……你不知道？我还以为他们已经通知你了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>暂时还没有人通知过我任何事，但你可以先说说看？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>太好了，警报解除，原来只是信息交流迟滞。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>我补全了我们的研究计划之后，直接在总部申报了全新的项目。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>现在项目评审已经通过了，不然你以为我是为什么在收拾行李？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>我们的研究项目？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>当然，你可是联合申报人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>虽然申报的时候并没有经过这位联合申报人本人同意，但她决定暂且略过这个无关紧要的细节。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>我们还拿到了绿棱镜他们项目的合作邀约，额外申请到了联合研发的预算，和项目的预算一起到账。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>所以，你收拾东西是因为……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>我在总部申请了办公室，我们可能得搬过去一阵，毕竟要拿那份联合研发的预算。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>何况他们还有很多咱们一定用得上、但不一定申请得到的实验器材！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>听起来真不错。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>除了我居然对此一无所知之外，简直挑不出毛病。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>没关系，现在知道也还不晚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>冷周六潇洒地摆了摆手。指针的脸上没有出现明显的表情波动，但四目相对十秒后，冷周六意识到自己应该端正态度。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>好吧，我确实有责任，但……我以为在我从总部赶到普列谢茨克的时间里，足够他们把通知发给你了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>可能他们也觉得你应该告诉我，没必要再额外发一个纸质通知。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>这太不正式了……或许纸质通知还在路上？或者更糟，在拖沓的行政人员的打字机里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>对行政效率的不满是她们较为常用的闲聊话题，很适合过渡尴尬，转移话题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>总之，并列一作是我的底线……呃，所以你会来的吧？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>我连你的预算和津贴都申请好了，还有独立办公室和实验室。如果你现在说你不打算参加这个项目的话……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>并列一作也是我的底线。我参加。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>不需要其他任何解释和剖白，她们开始了搬迁工作的规划，一如既往，简洁高效。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_1_bg_jiuba.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_1_bg_jiuba\"><img alt=\"2_1_bg_jiuba\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/Cg-2_1_bg_jiuba.png/600px-Cg-2_1_bg_jiuba.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/Cg-2_1_bg_jiuba.png/900px-Cg-2_1_bg_jiuba.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/Cg-2_1_bg_jiuba.png/1200px-Cg-2_1_bg_jiuba.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>出于种种原因，她们最终只组织起了一个很小型的聚餐来庆祝。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>命名日有任务要做，北方哨歌还没回来，含章鼎留了字条说要去干私活，而远旅被总部的研究组借调的命令又续期了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>真高兴你还在这儿，阿涅娅。不然我和指针又只能两个人吃了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633704.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-633704.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633704.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633704.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-633704.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633704.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7e/HeadIconSmall-633704.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633704.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小蛇Ⅴ：</div><div>明明是咱们和指针十个。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>我很荣幸，冷周六女士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩很认真地举起杯子里的果汁，和大家一一碰杯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>咱们第一次见面也算是在这儿，就连点的菜都差不多。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"633703.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-633703.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-633703.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"633703.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-633703.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-633703.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d3/HeadIconSmall-633703.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-633703.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小蛇Ⅰ：</div><div>发生了太多的事就是这样，日子过得又快又慢！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>所以，这会是我们最后一次，一起在这里吃饭吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>女孩环视着陌生又熟悉的餐馆，这并不是一个严格的问句。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>如果研究能顺利进展到航空发射实证，我们会回来的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>拉普拉斯和很多发射中心有合作……不过绿棱镜很喜欢这里，她说这里的雪原和极光都富有诗意。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>考虑到我们的项目有很密切的合作关系，她说不定会为了这个把我们弄回来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>我没有异议。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>我也都行。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>噢，差点忘了！我现在应该给阿涅娅一点情感支持才对。让我想想……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她一本正经，态度严肃，努力调动着不常使用的大脑分区。小蛇们在发间窃窃私语，热心地提供了不少建议。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>……这是什么新的研究吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>我之前和绿棱镜吵了一架，她指责我完全不能给同伴提供任何情感上的支持和反馈……我明明干得挺好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>是吧，阿涅娅？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>库珀花环不太擅长拒绝他人的好意。但她这次很努力，用上了所有气力，几乎要发光。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>……谢谢您，冷周六女士。但真的不用了，我现在很好，不需要安慰和鼓励。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>但我还需要更多的成功案例，你们知道的，样本大于三十个比较有说服力。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>虽然不知道上次发生了什么——我也不是很想知道——但，你还是停下吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>我觉得绿棱镜说得对，而你没必要改进。接受这一点作为你的个人特色吧，别折磨阿涅娅了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>冷周六露出不赞同的神色，为了避免可预见的反驳，指针决定举起酒杯，巧用聚餐礼仪。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_7_at_canguanhuitan6_zone.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_7_at_canguanhuitan6_zone\"><img alt=\"2_7_at_canguanhuitan6_zone\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/Cg-2_7_at_canguanhuitan6_zone.png/600px-Cg-2_7_at_canguanhuitan6_zone.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"695\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/Cg-2_7_at_canguanhuitan6_zone.png/900px-Cg-2_7_at_canguanhuitan6_zone.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/5/5a/Cg-2_7_at_canguanhuitan6_zone.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"932\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>还是来干一杯吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">指针：</div><div>为了庆祝项目申请报告通过，也为了下次相聚——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">库珀花环：</div><div>为了总有一天不再有暴雨——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">冷周六：</div><div>也为了星星。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-baiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"baiping\"><img alt=\"baiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/600px-Cg-baiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/900px-Cg-baiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/1200px-Cg-baiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "间隔月-08"}}